body:
**Summary**
This PR updates the tools API in chat widgets to be object-based instead of array-based. Updated usage:
```javascript
<Chat
  tools={{
    alertOnHello: {
      layoutComponent: ({ message, addToolResult }) => {
        return <div/>;
      },
      onToolCall: ({ addToolResult, input, ...toolCallOptions }) => {
        addToolResult({
          output: { text: 'output' },
        });
      },
    },
  }}
/>
```
